+<a href="/sel/b3-4.1-01/minimum-reserve-requirements" class="guide-internal-link" rel="bookmark">B3-4.1-01, Minimum Reserve Requirements</a><a href="#3646" class="pdf-internal-link">B3-4.1-01, Minimum Reserve Requirements</a></span>, and, if applicable <span data-langcode="en" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="9466666f-4101-4b9b-84c9-bb67a11d14e9" data-embed-button="internal_reference" data-entity-embed-display="view_mode:node.linked_title" data-entity-embed-display-settings="[]" class="embedded-entity">
